        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia AP-9029P, Square Maddox Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nChoose from either 12 inch or 18 inch center to center lengths for this ultra modern Maddox Square Appliance Handle. This Omnia Ultima III 9029P Appliance Pull is made for appliances like ovens and refrigerators that have panels on the front to accommodate custom handles. This Maddox Refrigerator Pull comes packaged with the hardware necessary to mount it on a standard appliance panel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 9029P Pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/maddox-square-cabinet-pull-collection-omnia-9029\"><b> Maddox Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia Ultima AP-9029P Maddox Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-9029P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-9029P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MGR-filigree-detail.jpg?v=1704354535\" width=\"524\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
